  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Emp 300 EMPLOYER REQUIREMENTS\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nDocument #13681, effective 5-22-13, repealed several definitions in Part Emp 301 titled “Definitions”, and adopted a new definition of “electronic media” in Emp 301.05. This necessitated renumbering, but not readopting, several other existing definitions in Part Emp 301 as indicated in the source notes.\n\nThe definitions repealed by Document #13681 included the following terms:",
